@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088

### Scenario 2: JSONPath body matching
POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/api/stateless/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment": {
    "amount": 2500,
    "currency": "THB"
  },
  "customer": {
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "name": "Alice"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-001"
    }
  ]
}
